data.comment:
EN: {0} QSOs were not delivered to DXKeeper this run. Click to show the file in its folder, import it into DXKeeper, then delete it. This count clears when the file is gone.

{1}
    NOTE: Tooltip once QSOs have failed. {0} is a count, {1} is the full path of the ADIF file - do not translate the path.

data.value:
Nelze otevřít {0}:

{1}

Použít odkaz na složku a importovat soubor do DXKeeper odtamtud.

data.comment:
EN: Could not open {0}:
{1}
Use the folder link and import the file into DXKeeper from there. NOTE: {0} is a filename, {1} is an operating-system error message. Do not translate either.

EN: Could not open the folder:

{0}
    NOTE: {0} is an operating-system error message - do not translate it.

EN: Nothing has been written to the error log yet:

{0}
    NOTE: {0} is the full path of ErrorLog.txt - do not translate it.

EN: Could not open ErrorLog.txt:

{0}
    NOTE: "ErrorLog.txt" is a filename - do not translate it. {0} is an operating-system error message.

EN: Could not open the help page:

{0}
    NOTE: {0} is an operating-system error message - do not translate it.

EN: INVALID: {0}
    NOTE: {0} describes what was wrong with a received datagram and stays in English - it is wire diagnostics that also goes to ErrorLog.txt.
    NOT TRANSLATED: left in English deliberately - either a do-not-translate entry, or the machine pass damaged it and was rejected.

EN: Could not open the licence file:

{0}
    NOTE: {0} is an operating-system error message - do not translate it.

